{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"ba0c2ea8ad83941bbd2f4943ac658f22f95de1867ac60bf56a97118ae0326355","digest":{"component_or_area":"completion recovery evidence agent","key_entities":["CompletionAgentStep._recover","completion_recovery.py","LLMBudgetExhaustedError","RunawayToolLoopError","UnretryableOutputError","_is_token_exhaustion","CompletionRecoveryError","completion_verdict","exhausted placeholder entry"],"problem_keywords":["budget exhaustion","bounded recovery","evidence gathering","per-criterion failure","partial evidence preservation","LLMBudgetExhaustedError"],"propositions":["A single criterion's budget exhaustion in evidence gathering causes the entire recovery to fail, discarding partial evidence from other criteria.","The per-criterion evidence loop treats budget exhaustion as fatal to the aggregate recovery rather than a per-criterion safeguard.","When one evidence run exhausts its step budget, the exception propagates out without preserving evidence from other criteria, forcing --force-close.","The finalizer is capable of rendering per-criterion verdicts and marking criteria unverifiable-within-bounds, but never receives partial evidence from exhausted runs.","Recovery should catch budget exhaustion and runaway tool loop exceptions per criterion, emit content-free placeholder entries, and continue to the finalizer unless all criteria fail."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787351058813514001,"uuid":"7d32a595-3eda-4cf0-a651-b36b6b6d60b3"}